00:58:45.280 --> 00:58:49.400
<v Peter Debernardi>It was like being sealed into a metal coffin.
<v Peter Debernardi>就像被密封进一个金属棺材里一样。

00:58:49.400 --> 00:58:56.370
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:56.370 --> 00:59:01.370
